{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-as-code-and-admission","title":"策略即代码与准入控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy/policy-as-code-and-admission","wordCount":2128,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"策略即代码与准入控制\">策略即代码与准入控制</h1><p>把「什么样的制品才允许进集群」写成可版本控制、可单元测试、可在 CI 与运行时双重执行的规则，这就是策略即代码（Policy as Code, PaC）。它和准入控制（admission control）的结合点很具体：当一个 <code>Pod</code> 请求到达 Kubernetes API Server，准入控制器会在对象被持久化之前拦截这次请求，对照策略判断「这个镜像签过名吗、它的 provenance 满足 SLSA 等级吗、它跑在 root 下吗」，不满足就直接拒绝。供应链攻击的最后一道闸往往就在这里——上游 CI 再怎么严，真正决定「坏制品能不能落到生产集群」的是准入这一刻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>策略即代码的价值在于把治理从「人工评审 + Wiki 上的约定」变成「机器可执行的断言」。规则用声明式语言写成文件，进 Git 仓库走 PR、做 review、跑测试、被 diff 审计;执行引擎在两个位置消费这些规则:一个是 CI 流水线里的左移检查（shift-left，构建时就拒绝），一个是集群准入这道运行时网关(右移兜底,防止有人绕过 CI 直接 <code>kubectl apply</code>)。两处用同一份策略,才能保证「测过的就是上线执行的」。</p>\n<p>准入控制在 Kubernetes 里分两类。一类是 mutating(变更)准入,在对象落库前改写它,比如自动注入 sidecar 或补全默认安全上下文;另一类是 validating(校验)准入,只做「放行/拒绝」的判断,不改对象。供应链安全主要落在 validating 这一侧:校验镜像签名、校验 provenance 证明、校验依赖来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[开发者 kubectl apply&lt;br/&gt;或 CD 推送] --&gt; B[API Server&lt;br/&gt;认证 + 鉴权]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Mutating 准入&lt;br/&gt;注入默认/补全安全上下文]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Validating 准入&lt;br/&gt;策略引擎评估]&#10;  D --&gt; E{策略通过?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[对象持久化到 etcd&lt;br/&gt;调度运行]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[拒绝请求&lt;br/&gt;返回违规原因]&#10;  H[Git 中的策略文件&lt;br/&gt;PaC 真理源] --&gt; I[CI 左移检查]&#10;  H --&gt; D&#10;  I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[开发者 kubectl apply&lt;br/&gt;或 CD 推送] --&gt; B[API Server&lt;br/&gt;认证 + 鉴权]\n  B --&gt; C[Mutating 准入&lt;br/&gt;注入默认/补全安全上下文]\n  C --&gt; D[Validating 准入&lt;br/&gt;策略引擎评估]\n  D --&gt; E{策略通过?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[对象持久化到 etcd&lt;br/&gt;调度运行]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[拒绝请求&lt;br/&gt;返回违规原因]\n  H[Git 中的策略文件&lt;br/&gt;PaC 真理源] --&gt; I[CI 左移检查]\n  H --&gt; D\n  I --&gt; A</pre><p>下表对比了 2026 年主流的策略引擎与准入工具在供应链场景下的取向:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>策略语言</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>供应链能力</th>\n<th>关键现状(2026)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OPA / Gatekeeper</td>\n<td>Rego</td>\n<td>CNCF 毕业的通用策略引擎</td>\n<td>通过外部数据校验,需自建签名验证集成</td>\n<td>Gatekeeper 把 OPA 适配为 K8s 准入控制器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kyverno</td>\n<td>YAML / CEL</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 原生策略引擎</td>\n<td>内置 <code>verifyImages</code> 直接验签,无需额外工具</td>\n<td>1.17(2026-02)把 CEL 策略类型提升到 v1 GA,旧 <code>ClusterPolicy</code> 标记弃用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sigstore policy-controller</td>\n<td>CUE / 内置</td>\n<td>专做基于 cosign 元数据的准入</td>\n<td>原生校验 cosign 签名与 attestation</td>\n<td>专注 keyless 验签与 provenance 强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes VAP</td>\n<td>CEL</td>\n<td>API Server 内建,无 webhook</td>\n<td>表达式级校验,无网络往返</td>\n<td><code>ValidatingAdmissionPolicy</code> 自 1.30 GA,Kyverno 可生成 VAP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源:<a href=\"https://spacelift.io/blog/policy-as-code-tools\">Spacelift: Top 12 Policy as Code Tools 2026</a>、<a href=\"https://kyverno.io/blog/2026/02/02/announcing-kyverno-release-1.17/\">Kyverno 1.17 发布公告</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/sigstore/policy-controller\">Sigstore policy-controller</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-rego-把约束写成可测试的断言\">用 Rego 把约束写成可测试的断言</h2><p>OPA 的策略语言 Rego 是一门声明式查询语言:你不写「怎么遍历」,只写「什么情况算违规」。在 Gatekeeper 模式下,一条约束由两部分组成——<code>ConstraintTemplate</code> 定义参数化的规则逻辑(Rego),<code>Constraint</code> 实例化它并指定作用范围。这种两段式让同一段逻辑可以被不同团队以不同阈值复用。</p>\n<p>下面这条模板要求所有镜像必须来自受信任的仓库前缀,否则准入拒绝:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"package supplychain.registries&#10;&#10;# 输入 input.review.object 是 API Server 转发的待准入对象&#10;violation[{&quot;msg&quot;: msg}] {&#10;    container := input.review.object.spec.containers[_]&#10;    not startswith(container.image, &quot;registry.internal.example/&quot;)&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;镜像 %v 不在受信任仓库前缀内&quot;, [container.image])&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package supplychain.registries</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 输入 input.review.object 是 API Server 转发的待准入对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violation[{\"msg\": msg}] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    container := input.review.object.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not startswith(container.image, \"registry.internal.example/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"镜像 %v 不在受信任仓库前缀内\", [container.image])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Rego 真正的好处是可单元测试。把策略当代码,意味着策略本身也要有测试覆盖——<code>opa test</code> 能对一段 Rego 跑 golden 用例,验证「该拒的拒、该放的放」。设策略对镜像集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 的判定函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(i) \\in \\{0, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示违规),测试就是固定一组样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{(i_k, y_k)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span> 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(i_k) = y_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。没有这层测试,策略上线后任何一次 <code>opa fmt</code> 之外的改动都可能悄悄放过坏制品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-kyverno-在准入处验证镜像签名\">用 Kyverno 在准入处验证镜像签名</h2><p>Kyverno 走的是另一条路:不引入新语言,策略就是 Kubernetes YAML(或自 1.17 起生产可用的 CEL 表达式)。对供应链来说它最有分量的能力是内置的 <code>verifyImages</code>——准入时直接调用 cosign 校验镜像签名,不必再拼接外部验签服务。据 <a href=\"https://kyverno.io/blog/2026/02/02/announcing-kyverno-release-1.17/\">Kyverno 1.17 发布公告</a>,该版本带来了 Cosign v3 支持,并把所有 CEL 策略类型提升到 API v1。</p>\n<p>一条强制 keyless 签名的策略大致如下:任何 <code>registry.internal.example/</code> 下的镜像,必须能用指定 OIDC 身份在 Sigstore 公共透明日志(Rekor)中验出签名,否则拒绝准入。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: require-signed-images&#10;spec:&#10;  validationFailureAction: Enforce # 直接拒绝,而非仅审计&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: verify-signature&#10;      match:&#10;        any:&#10;          - resources: { kinds: [&#39;Pod&#39;] }&#10;      verifyImages:&#10;        - imageReferences: [&#39;registry.internal.example/*&#39;]&#10;          attestors:&#10;            - entries:&#10;                - keyless:&#10;                    subject: &#39;https://github.com/example/*&#39;&#10;                    issuer: &#39;https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">require-signed-images</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  validationFailureAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Enforce</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 直接拒绝,而非仅审计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">verify-signature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      verifyImages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">imageReferences</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'registry.internal.example/*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          attestors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">keyless</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://github.com/example/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    issuer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>keyless 是这里的关键设计:cosign 在 CI 中用 OIDC 颁发的临时密钥签名,签名与「是哪个 GitHub Actions 工作流、哪个仓库」这一身份绑定,并写入 Rekor 透明日志,无需任何团队长期保管私钥(据 <a href=\"https://docs.sigstore.dev/\">Sigstore Cosign 文档</a> 与 <a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-09-cosign-sigstore-image-signing/view\">OneUptime: Cosign 与 Sigstore 镜像签名</a>)。准入控制器拉镜像时验证签名匹配且来自受信身份,失败即拒绝 Pod 启动——这道闸「无法被绕过」,因为它在 API Server 这一必经之路上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-签过名-到-来路可证-强制-slsa-provenance\">从「签过名」到「来路可证」:强制 SLSA provenance</h2><p>只验签名只能回答「这个镜像没被改过」,回答不了「它是怎么造出来的」。供应链攻击里更隐蔽的一类是「合法签名 + 被污染的构建过程」,所以更强的准入策略会进一步要求 provenance(来源证明):这个制品由哪条流水线、在什么源码 commit、用什么构建器产出。SLSA 框架用 in-toto attestation 格式承载这些声明,据 <a href=\"https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.0/distributing-provenance\">slsa.dev</a>,in-toto SLSA Provenance 是推荐的标准格式,且一份 attestation 一旦发布即不可变,不能被同一制品的另一份覆盖。</p>\n<p>准入端的做法是:CI 阶段为每个制品生成 attestation,准入 webhook 在创建 Pod 前校验它存在且满足等级要求(据 <a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-09-supply-chain-attestations-in-toto/view\">OneUptime: 为 K8s 镜像生成供应链 attestation</a>)。下表把三层校验强度拆开,对应不同的攻击防护:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验层级</th>\n<th>准入断言</th>\n<th>防住的攻击</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>签名验证</td>\n<td>镜像签名来自受信身份</td>\n<td>被篡改/伪造的镜像、被攻陷的仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provenance 存在</td>\n<td>制品带 SLSA provenance attestation</td>\n<td>来路不明、绕过 CI 直推的制品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provenance 内容断言</td>\n<td>构建器、源仓库、commit 满足策略</td>\n<td>污染的构建过程、非法分支构建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Kyverno 的 <code>verifyImages</code> 同样能校验 attestation 的内容字段,Sigstore policy-controller 则原生支持基于 cosign attestation 的准入决策。把这三层叠起来,准入策略表达的就是一个合取条件:制品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 放行当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sig</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mtext>prov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mtext>policy</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sig}(a) \\land \\text{prov}(a) \\land \\text{policy}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sig</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">policy</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 同时为真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地工程-审计模式-左移与渐进收紧\">落地工程:审计模式、左移与渐进收紧</h2><p>把策略一上来就设成 <code>Enforce</code> 是事故配方——存量集群里几乎一定有不合规的工作负载,硬执行会瞬间挡住正常发布。成熟的做法是渐进收紧:先用审计模式(Kyverno 的 <code>Audit</code>、Gatekeeper 的 <code>dryrun</code>)只记录违规不拦截,观察真实违规面,清理存量,再切到 <code>Enforce</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[策略进 Git&lt;br/&gt;写单元测试] --&gt; B[CI 左移&lt;br/&gt;conftest/opa test]&#10;  B --&gt; C[准入: Audit 模式&lt;br/&gt;只记录违规]&#10;  C --&gt; D[度量违规面&lt;br/&gt;清理存量负载]&#10;  D --&gt; E{违规收敛?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| D&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[切换 Enforce&lt;br/&gt;运行时硬拦截]&#10;  F --&gt; G[豁免走显式注解&lt;br/&gt;留审计痕迹]\">flowchart TD\n  A[策略进 Git&lt;br/&gt;写单元测试] --&gt; B[CI 左移&lt;br/&gt;conftest/opa test]\n  B --&gt; C[准入: Audit 模式&lt;br/&gt;只记录违规]\n  C --&gt; D[度量违规面&lt;br/&gt;清理存量负载]\n  D --&gt; E{违规收敛?}\n  E --&gt;|否| D\n  E --&gt;|是| F[切换 Enforce&lt;br/&gt;运行时硬拦截]\n  F --&gt; G[豁免走显式注解&lt;br/&gt;留审计痕迹]</pre><p>还有三条容易被忽视的工程纪律。其一,CI 左移与准入用同一份策略:在流水线里用 conftest 或 <code>opa test</code> 提前跑同一套规则,开发者在 PR 阶段就看到失败,而不是等到部署被准入拒绝才发现。其二,豁免必须显式且留痕——临时放行某个负载时用带审计意义的注解或专门的 exception 资源,而非偷偷放宽全局策略。其三,性能要量进决策:据 <a href=\"https://kyverno.io/blog/2026/02/02/announcing-kyverno-release-1.17/\">Kyverno 1.17 发布公告</a>,CEL 引擎相比旧的 JMESPath 引擎评估性能显著提升,并更贴近上游 Kubernetes 的 <code>ValidatingAdmissionPolicy</code>;在高频准入场景下,把可在 API Server 内联评估的规则下沉成 VAP(无 webhook 网络往返)能明显降低准入延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>策略即代码把治理变成可版本化、可测试、可审计的规则文件,准入控制是它在运行时的执行点——也是供应链坏制品落到生产集群的最后一道闸。</li>\n<li>校验分三层:签名验证(没被改过)、provenance 存在(有来路证明)、provenance 内容断言(来路满足要求),叠起来才覆盖「污染构建过程」这类隐蔽攻击。</li>\n<li>OPA/Gatekeeper 用 Rego(可 <code>opa test</code> 单元测试)、Kyverno 用 YAML/CEL(内置 <code>verifyImages</code> 直接对接 cosign)、Sigstore policy-controller 专做基于 cosign 元数据的准入,VAP 则在 API Server 内联无 webhook。</li>\n<li>Kyverno 1.17(2026-02)把 CEL 策略提升到 v1 GA、支持 Cosign v3、弃用旧 <code>ClusterPolicy</code>,CEL 成为对齐上游 VAP 的主路线。</li>\n<li>keyless 签名让 CI 用 OIDC 临时密钥签名并写入 Rekor 透明日志,签名绑定到「哪个工作流、哪个仓库」的身份,无需团队保管长期私钥。</li>\n<li>落地走渐进收紧:先 Audit 观察、清理存量、再 Enforce;左移与准入共用同一份策略;豁免显式留痕;高频路径用 VAP 降延迟。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"策略即代码与准入控制","id":"策略即代码与准入控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Rego 把约束写成可测试的断言","id":"用-rego-把约束写成可测试的断言"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Kyverno 在准入处验证镜像签名","id":"用-kyverno-在准入处验证镜像签名"},{"level":2,"text":"从「签过名」到「来路可证」:强制 SLSA provenance","id":"从-签过名-到-来路可证-强制-slsa-provenance"},{"level":2,"text":"落地工程:审计模式、左移与渐进收紧","id":"落地工程-审计模式-左移与渐进收紧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"加固的构建流水线（Hardened Build Pipelines）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy/hardened-build-pipelines"},"next":{"title":"供应链事件响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy/supply-chain-incident-response"}}